cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this prototype, cite the repository and the exact commit and dataset hash."
title: "MLX Biomedical Memory: Controlled Conditional-Memory and Graph-Composition Experiments"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nesta
    given-names: Alex V.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
url: "https://github.com/alexvnesta/mlx-biomedical-memory"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An experimental Apple-silicon implementation of separately trained latent
  memory for a frozen Qwen3-4B, with controlled supplied-path composition tests
  and ARAX-derived rare-disease snapshot-membership tasks. Results are
  exploratory and do not establish therapeutic efficacy or clinical utility.
